,"text":"合成四大散成空，草木经春便有冬。\n生灭去来相对代，为君题作有常钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31878,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏题无常钟二绝 其一","author":"范成大","text":"著衫脱裤两浮休，切莫随渠认路头。\n三尺蒲牢关底事，寻声接响大悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31879,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏题牡丹","author":"范成大","text":"主人细意惜芳春，宝帐笼阶护紫云。\n风日等閒犹不到，外边蜂蝶莫纷纷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31880,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏题药裹","author":"范成大","text":"捲却丝纶飏却竿，莫随鱼鳖弄腥涎。\n须知别有垂钩处，枯海无风浪拍天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31881,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏题赵从善两画轴三首 其三","author":"范成大","text":"搔头珠重步微摇，约臂金寒束未牢。\n要见低鬟揎玉腕，更须斜抱紫檀槽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31882,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏题赵从善两画轴三首 其二","author":"范成大","text":"无笑无言两断魂，一杯谁为煖霜寒。\n情知别有真真在，试与千呼万唤看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31883,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏题赵从善两画轴三首 其一","author":"范成大","text":"一枝香杏一枝梅，各占东风挂玉钗。\n居士石肠都似梦，王孙心眼怎安排。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31884,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏题致远书房","author":"范成大","text":"照丛菊靥万黄金，欹架薇条半绿阴。\n逋客已随丹凤诏，但馀花草怨秋深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31885,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏赠少梁","author":"范成大","text":"屈膝铜铺昼掩关，薰炉谁伴夕香寒。\n秋来合有相思字，会待风前片叶看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31886,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏赠脚婆","author":"范成大","text":"日满东窗照被堆，宿汤犹自暖如煨。\n尺三汗脚君休笑，曾踏靴霜待漏来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31887,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵马少伊郁舜举寄示同游石湖诗卷七首 其七","author":"范成大","text":"潇洒王郎亦胜流，今年何事阻清游。\n当家风味今如此，孤负山阴夜雪舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31888,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵马少伊郁舜举寄示同游石湖诗卷七首 其六","author":"范成大","text":"得得来题小隐诗，拂香萦柳画船移。\n湖边好景春犹未，须到秋清月满时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31889,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵马少伊郁舜举寄示同游石湖诗卷七首 其五","author":"范成大","text":"两贤风度蔼春阳，步屧随风上柳塘。\n綵笔红笺芳径里，句中挟我万花香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31890,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵马少伊郁舜举寄示同游石湖诗卷七首 其四","author":"范成大","text":"红皱黄团熟暑风，甘瓜削玉藕玲珑。\n身谋已落园丁后，满帽京尘日正中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31891,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵马少伊郁舜举寄示同游石湖诗卷七首 其三","author":"范成大","text":"镜面波光倒碧峰，半湖云锦万芙蓉。\n去年荡桨香风里，行傍石桥花正浓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31892,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵马少伊郁舜举寄示同游石湖诗卷七首 其二","author":"范成大","text":"莫问朝歌与棘津，浮生惟有一杯春。\n君看百战功名地，越戍吴台两窖尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31893,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵马少伊郁舜举寄示同游石湖诗卷七首 其一","author":"范成大","text":"芜城老藓不知春，忽有柴门月色新。\n芝草琅玕无锁钥，自无超俗扣门人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31894,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐先生吴中见寄八首 其二","author":"范成大","text":"官居门巷果园西，桃李成蹊杏压枝。\n如许年芳忙里过，斩新今日试题诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31895,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐先生吴中见寄八首 其五","author":"范成大","text":"送春濛雨涨蘋滩，荷叶田田柳絮阑。\n想见垂虹三万顷，拍天湖水钓丝寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31896,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐先生吴中见寄八首 其一","author":"范成大","text":"金鹤飞来尺素通，新诗字字挟光风。\n三年湖海关心处，都在先生句子中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31897,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐先生吴中见寄八首 其六","author":"范成大","text":"知从了义透音闻，古井无波岂更浑。\n便好一坑埋众妙，何须六结解诸根。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31898,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐先生吴中见寄八首 其四","author":"范成大","text":"懒不看书似姓边，梦魂飞绕白鸥前。\n须知席帽冲尘出，不似篷窗听雨眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31899,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐先生吴中见寄八首 其三","author":"范成大","text":"暮林栖鸟各深枝，燕子知巢触幔飞。\n倘有三椽今已去，不关五斗解忘归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31900,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐先生吴中见寄八首 其八","author":"范成大","text":"粟囊聊复寄三餐，埋没缁尘懒濯冠。\n红紫百般纷过眼，乡山岁晚自苍官。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31901,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐先生吴中见寄八首 其七","author":"范成大","text":"几多蝼蚁与王侯，往古来今共一丘。\n遮莫功名掀宇宙，百年两角寄蜗牛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31902,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐先生除夜三绝 其二","author":"范成大","text":"天边客里五迎冬，争信还乡似寓公。\n人事都非城郭是，独怜鸡犬识新丰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31903,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐先生除夜三绝 其三","author":"范成大","text":"床头历日鬓丝丝，懒倦慵吟守岁诗。\n宜入新年须吉利，明朝把笔写门楣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31904,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵乐先生除夜三绝 其一","author":"范成大","text":"团蒲曲几坐成痴，北看南观恍是非。\n道眼已空诗眼在，梅花欲动雪花稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31905,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵代答刘文潜司业二绝 其一","author":"范成大","text":"平羌江上首空回，慈姥岩前定把杯。\n纵使石肠都忘却，也应风雨送愁来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31906,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵代答刘文潜司业二绝 其二","author":"范成大","text":"回廊月下短歌行，惟有知音解有情。\n一曲红窗声里怨，如今分作两愁城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31907,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵汉卿舅即事二绝 其二","author":"范成大","text":"万木垂垂欲改柯，根萌焦渴奈春何。\n晚来础汗南风壮，会有溪云载雨过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31908,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵汉卿舅即事二绝 其一","author":"范成大","text":"风捲南枝一夜休，孤芳宁肯为人留。\n淡妆素服真成梦，落月横参各自愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31909,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵汉卿舅腊梅二首 其一","author":"范成大","text":"垂垂瘦萼泫微霜，剪剪纤英锁暗香。\n金雀钗头金蛱蝶，春风传得旧宫妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31910,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵汉卿舅腊梅二首 其二","author":"范成大","text":"湘袂朝天紫锦裳，光风微度绛霄香。\n寿阳信美无仙骨，空把心情学澹妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31911,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]